	)
	(text "Bench inhibit for the FC's live pyro/heater driver U6 (TPS4H160): one switch force-lows\nall three EN nets (Deploy1_EN, Heater_EN, Deploy2_EN) through Schottky diodes so an\ninhibited bench is always safe by default. Also carries six parallel bench-shunt headers\nacross the existing RBF/inhibit-chain break points (D6) so the bench can be operated\nwithout Pico-Lock crimp pigtails."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 24.13 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "f6a6bb27-fa4a-4d15-a6a8-683b138f1d38")
	)
	(text "EN-Line Force-Low Diodes (D1) -- flight_controller_board#53 (ch3/ch4 crossed) is unresolved,\nso the heater channel cannot be assumed non-pyro; one inhibit covers all three EN nets."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.0 1.0)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c18e5fdf-bc37-4672-accf-224877d95bba")
	)
	(text "Test points (Ref/Value hidden on-canvas; net name shown here):\n  TP600 = Deploy1_EN   TP601 = Heater_EN   TP602 = Deploy2_EN   TP603 = PYRO_INH_COM"
